# Shrewd Storyteller, Survival: "At the beginning of your second main phase, if this creature is tapped, put a +1/+1 counter on
# target creature." Cast on turn 1 off Mox Emerald, Mox Pearl and Mox Jet. On turn 3 it does not attack: it is untapped at the
# second main phase and nothing triggers (the intervening "if", CR 603.4). On turn 5 it attacks (no vigilance, so tapped) and at
# the second main phase Bot1 targets Bot2's Ornithopter, a creature it does not control, but not Mox Jet (an artifact that is not a
# creature): Ornithopter becomes 1/3. On Bot2's turn 6 the Storyteller is still tapped but it is not Bot1's second main phase
# (CR 603.2, "your"): nothing triggers.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Shrewd Storyteller
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

